{"repositoryId":1419496279,"availability":"available","full":"MrLouisWright/favipulse","name":"favipulse","description":"Tiny (<3 KB gz), zero-dependency, typed favicon library: deterministic generative/identicon favicons from a seed with self-drawing animation, badges, progress rings and pulse, plus per-environment (dev/staging/prod) icons. CLI generates svg/ico/png sets + manifest. Vite & Next.js helpers. Modern replacement for favico.js and tinycon.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-14T17:05:35Z","updated":"2026-10-15T10:01:18Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mrlouiswright.github.io/favipulse/","topics":["environment","favicon","favicon-badge","generative-art","identicon","nextjs","notification","progress","svg","vite-plugin"],"demo":"https://mrlouiswright.github.io/favipulse/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:48.194Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:48.194Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:48.194Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T18:04:48.194Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Favicons that say something: who, where, and what's happening.","Live demo → · Docs (wiki) · Migrating from favico.js / tinycon","favipulse draws a deterministic generative favicon from any seed (with an optional self-drawing animation), shows badges, a progress ring for builds and uploads and a pulse when something needs attention, and gives dev, staging and prod their own icon so you never ship from the wrong tab again. A CLI and Vite / Next.js helpers generate static favicon.svg, favicon.ico, PNG sizes and a manifest snippet per environment."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MrLouisWright/favipulse/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"67e9b880becd77184c168ffa592e08ee48e1a28b275268924eb9a0e7bd88c25d","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:48.293Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:48.293Z","projectIn